WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:02.435
-I'm gonna ask you
for some silly words,

00:00:02.435 --> 00:00:04.136
nouns, verbs, adjectives,
et cetera.

00:00:04.136 --> 00:00:06.539
As we do that, they'll
be written onto cue cards, okay?

00:00:06.539 --> 00:00:09.275
And then we'll act out
a dramatic Mad Libs scene

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:10.643
right here, live,
in front of our audience.

00:00:10.643 --> 00:00:11.777
You ready for this?
-All right.

00:00:11.777 --> 00:00:12.812
-All right, here we go.
Very good.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.281
All right,
now we need some words.

00:00:15.281 --> 00:00:16.482
Give me a number.

00:00:16.482 --> 00:00:17.884
-6,000.

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:19.485
[ Light laughter ]

00:00:19.485 --> 00:00:21.287
-Give me a male name.

00:00:21.287 --> 00:00:23.256
-Um...

00:00:23.256 --> 00:00:24.824
Donald.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.893
[ Laughter ]

00:00:27.893 --> 00:00:30.062
-Give me a pet name
for a rabbit.

00:00:30.062 --> 00:00:32.565
-Fuzzy.
-Aww.

00:00:32.565 --> 00:00:33.866
An adjective.

00:00:33.866 --> 00:00:36.503
-Stinky.

00:00:36.503 --> 00:00:38.571
-What you'd shout
if your dentist told you,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:41.674
"You have six cavities."

00:00:41.674 --> 00:00:43.376
-"I hate candy!"

00:00:43.376 --> 00:00:45.211
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.014
-"I hate candy"?
-Like, "I didn't do it."

00:00:48.014 --> 00:00:49.983
-I know.
"How is this possible?" yeah.

00:00:49.983 --> 00:00:53.652
-It's not my fault.
-Amount of time.

00:00:53.652 --> 00:00:55.922
-17 weeks.

00:00:55.922 --> 00:00:57.456
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.492
-What a bar--
What a bartender would say

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:02.094
to customers
when the bar's closing.

00:01:02.094 --> 00:01:04.097
-Last call?
-Yeah.

00:01:04.097 --> 00:01:07.600
-Is that really boring?
-No, it's just very accurate.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:10.369
[ Laughter ]
Historical event.

00:01:10.369 --> 00:01:11.938
-The Revolutionary War.

00:01:11.938 --> 00:01:14.307
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.542
-Adjective to describe a fish.

00:01:16.542 --> 00:01:18.311
-Slimy.

00:01:18.311 --> 00:01:19.546
-Body part.

00:01:19.546 --> 00:01:21.681
-Oh. Knees.

00:01:21.681 --> 00:01:25.651
[ Light laughter ]
Keep it clean.

00:01:25.651 --> 00:01:27.386
-Plural occupations.

00:01:27.386 --> 00:01:30.223
-Scuba divers.

00:01:30.223 --> 00:01:31.357
-Somebody said "yes"
in the audience.

00:01:31.357 --> 00:01:32.992
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:34.394
"Yes! Finally."

00:01:34.394 --> 00:01:36.595
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.595 --> 00:01:38.197
Plural animals.

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:39.398
-Llamas.

00:01:39.398 --> 00:01:40.966
-Llamas.

00:01:40.966 --> 00:01:43.469
Verb ending in I-N-G.

00:01:43.469 --> 00:01:45.772
-Um...ghosting.

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:48.074
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.809
-Celebrity name.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:53.579
-Kim Kardashian.

00:01:53.579 --> 00:01:55.114
-Plural type of food.

00:01:55.114 --> 00:01:57.917
-Bananas.

00:01:57.917 --> 00:02:00.152
-Character from "Friends."

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:01.353
-Rachel.

00:02:01.353 --> 00:02:02.888
[ Cheers ]

00:02:02.888 --> 00:02:07.159
-Insult a kid would say.

00:02:07.159 --> 00:02:09.963
-You couldn't
carry a blank strap.

00:02:09.963 --> 00:02:11.397
[ Laughter ]

00:02:11.397 --> 00:02:13.399
Is that right?

00:02:13.399 --> 00:02:14.500
Is that what it is?

00:02:14.500 --> 00:02:20.273
♪♪

00:02:20.273 --> 00:02:22.275
[ Laughing ]

00:02:22.275 --> 00:02:31.384
♪♪

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:32.619
-Gosh.

00:02:32.619 --> 00:02:34.387
That is the perfect answer.

00:02:34.387 --> 00:02:35.989
[ Laughter ]

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:39.058
"You couldn't carry
a blank strap."

00:02:39.058 --> 00:02:40.526
-Is that --
Is that what it is?

00:02:40.526 --> 00:02:42.295
I didn't really get it.
-Something like that, yeah.

00:02:42.295 --> 00:02:43.496
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.496 --> 00:02:46.499
Another insult a kid would say.
Another one.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.234
-You suck at "Fortnite"!

00:02:48.234 --> 00:02:54.340
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.340 --> 00:02:56.709
-One more insult a kid
would say, then I'm done.

00:02:56.709 --> 00:02:58.444
-Um...

00:02:58.444 --> 00:03:00.980
You look like a Cheeto.

00:03:00.980 --> 00:03:03.282
[ Laughter ]

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:07.753
I have like one sigh with that.
-Yes, I hear you.

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:09.321
I hear you.
-Okay.

00:03:09.321 --> 00:03:10.723
-Plural object.

00:03:10.723 --> 00:03:13.960
-Um...chairs.

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:15.094
-Verb.

00:03:15.094 --> 00:03:17.463
-Um...
Um...

00:03:17.463 --> 00:03:19.532
Flush.

00:03:19.532 --> 00:03:22.835
-A body -- Another body part.

00:03:22.835 --> 00:03:24.003
-Uh, butt.

00:03:24.003 --> 00:03:25.805
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.805 --> 00:03:26.973
-Another verb.

00:03:26.973 --> 00:03:29.542
-Um...

00:03:29.542 --> 00:03:30.910
Fart.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.778
I do this with my son a lot,

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:36.081
so I, like, kind of have
set answers.

00:03:36.081 --> 00:03:38.484
-Cartoon character.

00:03:38.484 --> 00:03:43.523
-Mickey Mouse.

00:03:43.523 --> 00:03:46.592
-One more.
Last verb ending in I-N-G.

00:03:46.592 --> 00:03:48.327
-Sniffing.

00:03:48.327 --> 00:03:49.562
[ Laughter ]

00:03:49.562 --> 00:03:50.830
-There you go, right there.

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:53.032
Okay, we have filled out
all the words for our scene.

00:03:53.032 --> 00:03:54.434
Are you ready to perform it?

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:55.868
-So excited.
-All right, here we go.

00:03:55.868 --> 00:03:57.803
-All right.
-Let's do this.

00:03:57.803 --> 00:04:04.043
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:04.043 --> 00:04:06.045
♪♪

00:04:06.045 --> 00:04:07.880
[ Birds chirping ]

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.015
[ Laughter ]

00:04:10.015 --> 00:04:13.453
Really is --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:13.453 --> 00:04:16.588
Really is a beautiful
day to go apple picking.

00:04:16.588 --> 00:04:19.192
This is the most fun
I've had in 6,000 years.

00:04:19.192 --> 00:04:21.193
[ Laughter ]

00:04:21.193 --> 00:04:26.999
-Listen, Donald, I've been
thinking, and we need to talk.

00:04:26.999 --> 00:04:28.134
-What is it, Fuzzy?

00:04:28.134 --> 00:04:30.436
[ Laughter ]

00:04:30.436 --> 00:04:34.039
-What I'm about to say
might be stinky to hear,

00:04:34.039 --> 00:04:36.209
but here it goes.

00:04:36.209 --> 00:04:39.445
I think we should break up.

00:04:39.445 --> 00:04:40.613
-I hate candy!

00:04:40.613 --> 00:04:42.782
[ Laughter ]

00:04:42.782 --> 00:04:44.617
-I'm so sorry.

00:04:44.617 --> 00:04:48.121
We've shared so much
over the past 17 weeks, but...

00:04:48.121 --> 00:04:49.488
[ Laughter ]

00:04:49.488 --> 00:04:51.590
...last call.

00:04:51.590 --> 00:04:56.262
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:56.262 --> 00:04:59.031
-That's cold.

00:04:59.031 --> 00:05:01.600
How long have you've
been feeling this way?

00:05:01.600 --> 00:05:03.602
-Since the Revolutionary War.

00:05:03.602 --> 00:05:08.607
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:08.607 --> 00:05:09.775
-I can't believe this.

00:05:09.775 --> 00:05:12.011
Is this because
of my slimy knees?

00:05:12.011 --> 00:05:14.046
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.046 --> 00:05:15.447
-No, no, it's not.

00:05:15.447 --> 00:05:18.417
We're just -- We're just
really different people.

00:05:18.417 --> 00:05:20.786
I was brought up
by two scuba divers.

00:05:20.786 --> 00:05:22.387
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:05:22.387 --> 00:05:24.289
-And you were raised by llamas.

00:05:24.289 --> 00:05:26.592
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:26.592 --> 00:05:31.163
I enjoy --
I enjoy going out,

00:05:31.163 --> 00:05:34.900
and come home every night to
find you ghosting on the couch,

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:38.804
watching YouTube videos of
Kim Kardashian eating bananas.

00:05:38.804 --> 00:05:48.815
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:05:48.815 --> 00:05:50.717
-I understand.
Well, I have something

00:05:50.717 --> 00:05:54.253
to tell you, too,
that's not easy to admit.

00:05:54.253 --> 00:05:56.656
I've been cheating on you
with Rachel from "Friends."

00:05:56.656 --> 00:05:58.757
[ Laughter ]

00:05:58.757 --> 00:06:01.127
-You couldn't
carry a blank strap!

00:06:01.127 --> 00:06:02.862
[ Laughter ]

00:06:02.862 --> 00:06:05.932
-You --
You suck at "Fortnite"!

00:06:05.932 --> 00:06:07.099
[ Laughter ]

00:06:07.099 --> 00:06:09.769
-Well, you cook --
you look like a Cheeto!

00:06:09.769 --> 00:06:10.837
[ Laughter ]

00:06:10.837 --> 00:06:12.838
-Hey!

00:06:12.838 --> 00:06:15.274
-I'm taking the chairs
and moving out.

00:06:15.274 --> 00:06:16.342
[ Laughter ]
-Hey!

00:06:16.342 --> 00:06:18.744
Hey, please --
please don't flush.

00:06:18.744 --> 00:06:22.949
[ Light laughter ]

00:06:22.949 --> 00:06:25.818
That's a term that my llama
parents used to say.

00:06:25.818 --> 00:06:27.253
[ Laughter ]

00:06:27.253 --> 00:06:30.622
I hate seeing you do that,
so just have a seat here.

00:06:30.622 --> 00:06:32.425
I'm sorry
things didn't work out.

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:34.259
-I am, too.

00:06:34.259 --> 00:06:36.529
I'll --
[ Laughs ]

00:06:36.529 --> 00:06:38.831
[ Laughter ]

00:06:38.831 --> 00:06:41.300
I'll always --
[ Both laugh ]

00:06:41.300 --> 00:06:45.638
I'll always have a special
place for you in my butt.

00:06:45.638 --> 00:06:55.647
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:06:55.647 --> 00:07:00.585
[ Laughter continues ]

00:07:00.585 --> 00:07:02.188
-It's during --

00:07:02.188 --> 00:07:04.423
[ Laughter ]

00:07:04.423 --> 00:07:05.624
It's during times like this,

00:07:05.624 --> 00:07:11.229
I like for us to recite
our favorite love quote.

00:07:11.229 --> 00:07:14.633
-"You got to fart
like Mickey Mouse is watching."

00:07:14.633 --> 00:07:19.438
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:07:19.438 --> 00:07:22.941
"And you got to love
like there's nobody sniffing."

00:07:22.941 --> 00:07:24.209
And scene!

00:07:24.209 --> 00:07:25.578
-There you go.
Thank you.

00:07:25.578 --> 00:07:28.548
My thanks to Natalie Portman!

